cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or benchmark, please cite this release."
type: software
title: "GraphKAN AMO NQS: Boundary Conditioned Pair Jastrow Benchmark and Reproducibility Release"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Subhojith90/GraphKAN"
url: "https://github.com/Subhojith90/GraphKAN"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility release for boundary conditioned pair Jastrow neural quantum
  state benchmarks in one dimensional Rydberg chains. The release contains the
  frozen ten site campaign, independent Linux replay, twelve site continuation,
  gauge and counterfactual analyses, source code, configurations, tests,
  checksums, and complete reviewer evidence. The results define an observable
  dependent and protocol dependent representation effect rather than general
  KAN or Graph KAN superiority.
